      "historical_evidence_messages": [
        {
          "message_id": 1,
          "conversation_turn_index": 1,
          "speaker": "client",
          "text": "Hi Naveed,\n\nOur small nonprofit organization (<http://silverpine-studio.example|silverpine-studio.example>) is launching a YouTube channel, and we need a thumbnail for our first video. Ideally, it would be ready by the end of next week (thursday or friday). If you can help, I can send the video, a google doc containing thumbnail ideas and guidance, and one thumbnail I tried making myself. We would prefer the thumbnail not to contain AI-created assets, although minor AI-assisted edits such as generative fill in photoshop are probably okay. Would you be able to help?",
          "created_ts": null,
          "original_index": 0
        },
        {
          "message_id": 17,
          "conversation_turn_index": 17,
          "speaker": "freelancer",
          "text": "For transparency, here is the section of Ai I may use. I do not use Ai for asset creation, though I might generate some elements or alter parts of photos with Generative Ai or other Ai's. Whatever is changed would be kept natural so it does not look made by Ai.",
          "created_ts": null,
          "original_index": 16
        },
        {
          "message_id": 19,
          "conversation_turn_index": 19,
          "speaker": "client",
          "text": "I'd prefer that you not use either of those methods—please don't generate new elements or alter parts of the photographs that way.",
          "created_ts": null,
          "original_index": 18
        },
        {
          "message_id": 20,
          "conversation_turn_index": 20,
          "speaker": "client",
          "text": "What we consider acceptable is limited AI editing, such as using photoshop's generative fill to remove a distracting prop from the background.",
          "created_ts": null,
          "original_index": 19
        },
        {
          "message_id": 24,
          "conversation_turn_index": 24,
          "speaker": "client",
          "text": "You're welcome to share the examples, since I'm curious about your process. However, if it involves uploading images to ChatGPT/Gemini/Midjourney/etc. and asking the service to make changes, we would probably veto that approach.",
          "created_ts": null,
          "original_index": 23
        }
      ]
    },
